<p>
Each <code>worldgen/blockpatches/*.json</code> file is a flat list of placement rules -- a climate
band (temperature/rain/forest-density/fertility range) plus the literal, already-concrete block
codes it can place. Unlike deposits, no variant expansion or template substitution is needed here;
<code>blockCodes</code> already lists exactly what gets placed. The filename itself (e.g.
<code>flowers.json</code>, <code>mushrooms.json</code>) becomes this wiki's category label for
the patch.
</p>
